<mxfile host="drawio"><diagram name="Training and evaluation" id="Training and evaluation"><mxGraphModel dx="1570" dy="910" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" page="1" pageWidth="1570" pageHeight="910" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c3" value="A  Data" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#9A9A9A;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#333333;fontFamily=Helvetica;arcSize=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="10" y="10" width="560" height="560" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;WLASL v0.3 → WLASL100&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;100 words (the organisers' list)&lt;br&gt;1,466 clips found (2,038 listed)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="55" width="250" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;Split by signer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;train 1,044 / val 221 / test 201&lt;br&gt;val signers never in train" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="55" width="250" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;Kaggle ASL Signs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;94,477 phone clips, 250 signs,&lt;br&gt;21 signers (pre-training)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="175" width="250" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;MediaPipe Holistic&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;same landmark model as the app&lt;br&gt;→ T x 88 x 3 per clip" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;fontColor=#1A1A1